    title: "javascript/typescript: an unresolved bare-name call carries no 'bound by no import' marker the catalogue gates can read, so the external placeholder short-name-matches function rows (unbound readFileSync(p) tags fs_read) and a call through a parameter or local value is refused outright (no edge)"  # f09a
    status: todo_hard  # f09a
    priority: 3  # f09a
    parent:  # f09a
